{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_cache", "label": "Cache-Interface", "file_type": "code", "rationale": "Sieben Operationen decken rund 95 Prozent der realen Faelle ab; bewusst kleine Oberflaeche ohne Pattern-Scans und ohne Pub/Sub, das der Cluster selbst mitbringt.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_setifabsent", "label": "setIfAbsent", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Atomaritaet ist eine Garantie, kein Best Effort: jedes Backend bildet es auf ein natives Compare-and-Set ab (SET NX, ADD, ein Map-Paar), nie auf get-dann-set. ttlMs gilt nur fuer den gewinnenden Schreibvorgang, eine Retry-Schleife kann also nie fremden Besitz verlaengern.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_incr", "label": "incr (atomares Inkrement)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Liefert den neuen Zaehlerstand; die TTL wird nur gesetzt, wenn der Zaehler gerade erzeugt wurde \u2014 genau die Fixed-Window-Semantik der Rate-Limit-Middleware.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_acquirelock", "label": "acquireLock", "file_type": "code", "rationale": "setIfAbsent liefert nur die Acquire-Haelfte; bei der Release-Haelfte gehen selbstgebaute Varianten schief, deshalb bringt das Framework eine mit. ttlMs ist Pflicht, weil Ablauf der einzige Weg zurueck ist, wenn ein Halter abstuerzt.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_token_checked_release", "label": "Tokengeprueftes Release", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Ein zufaelliges 128-Bit-Token als Wert, und release() loescht den Key nur, wenn es noch dort steht; das naive delete im finally wirft den neuen Besitzer raus, sobald ein Halter seine TTL ueberzieht. Der false-Rueckgabewert meldet genau das: der Abschnitt war womoeglich nicht exklusiv.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_opportunistic_semantics", "label": "Opportunistische Semantik", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Caches sind per Design verlustbehaftet: None heisst nicht-gecacht, und der Aufrufer faellt auf die Quelle der Wahrheit zurueck. Implementierungen liefern bei transienten Fehlern Defaults, statt zu werfen; Missbrauch wirft.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_ttl_semantics", "label": "TTL-Semantik", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Ohne ttlMs bleibt ein Eintrag bis zur Eviction; explizite TTLs sind vorhersehbar, deshalb lautet die Empfehlung, immer eine zu setzen.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_bulk_operations", "label": "Bulk-Operationen (mget/mset)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Round-Trip-Optimierung, entscheidend fuer die Hydratation gesharder Entitaeten nach einem Rebalance \u2014 den State jeder aktiven Entitaet in einem Call statt in N.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_no_consensus_lock", "label": "Kein Lock mit verteiltem Konsens", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Das Compare-and-Delete in release() ist get plus delete, kein atomarer Schritt \u2014 die Cache-Oberflaeche hat kein Compare-and-Delete, und ein Redis-Lua-Skript haette kein Memcached-Aequivalent. Das Restfenster ist schmal, aber nicht null.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_shared_instance_hazard", "label": "Keine Instanz zwischen einer Garantie und einer Key-Flut teilen", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Ein begrenzter Cache evictet allein nach Aktualitaet, also gibt ein Eintrag, der eine Garantie traegt, genauso nach wie ein Response-Body; jeder Consumer braucht seine eigene benannte Instanz.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_cache", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_setifabsent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_cache", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_incr", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_cache", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_bulk_operations", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_cache", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_ttl_semantics", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_acquirelock", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_setifabsent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_token_checked_release", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_acquirelock", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_no_consensus_lock", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_token_checked_release", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_opportunistic_semantics", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_cache", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_shared_instance_hazard", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_cache", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/overview.mdx", "source_location": null